    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "וְקוֹמַת הַכֹּתֶרֶת שָׁלֹשׁ אַמָּה וּשְׂבָכָה",
      "rationale": "D acu i d-yettwassen ɣef tlata n yima: taxfiwt weḥd-s (ASV\/JPS) neɣ taxfiwt s uzetta (Geneva\/KJV 'with networke three cubites')?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "על ... על",
      "rationale": "Asnirem n 'על' snat n tikkal deg tgara n ufra ('al ha-ktoret' \/ 'al ha-sbaka'), d umsedri i ur yeqqimen ara deg tsuqilt."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Tmanya d mraw n yima d teɣzi n yiwen n tiǧǧa; taxfiwt-is d nneḥḥas, d teɣzi n texfiwt ⟨d⟩ tlata n yima, d uzetta d rummanen ɣef texfiwt, i tudert — akk ⟨d⟩ nneḥḥas; am tagi i tiǧǧa tis-snat, ɣef uzetta.",
